const Classic={mode:'grid',sort:'recent'};
paths.account='M20 21v-2a6 6 0 0 0-6-6h-4a6 6 0 0 0-6 6v2M16 6a4 4 0 1 1-8 0 4 4 0 0 1 8 0';
const classicEdit=edit,classicSaveProperty=saveProperty;
edit=function(){if(Market.user){if(buyerSide()){go('classicAccount');return}go('sellerEdit',args);return}classicEdit();const form=$('propertyForm');if(!form)return;const p=state.listings.find(x=>x.id===args.id)||{},x=p.insights||{};const fields=['projectName','builder','areaBasis','carpetArea','superArea','floor','parking','rera','oc','maintenance','lengthM','widthM','landUse','roadStatus','water','power','drainage','boundary'];const submit=form.querySelector('[type=submit]');submit.insertAdjacentHTML('beforebegin',`<details><summary>More plot / flat insights (optional)</summary><p class="mini muted">Enter only known facts. These are seller statements, not verified records.</p><div class="grid">${fields.map(k=>input(extraLabels[k],'insight_'+k,x[k],numericExtras.has(k)?'number':'text',false,numericExtras.has(k)?'min="0" step="any"':'')).join('')}</div></details>`)};
saveProperty=async function(e){if(Market.user)return classicSaveProperty(e);const fields=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(e.target)),insights={};for(const [k,v] of Object.entries(fields)){if(k.startsWith('insight_')&&v!==''){const name=k.slice(8);insights[name]=numericExtras.has(name)?+v:v}}await classicSaveProperty(e);if(route==='detail'){const p=state.listings.find(x=>x.id===args.id);if(p){p.insights=insights;for(const k of Object.keys(p))if(k.startsWith('insight_'))delete p[k];persist();render()}}};
function classicSaved(){return Market.user&&buyerSide()?Market.saved:state.saved}
function classicRows(){const q=view.q.trim().toLowerCase();let rows=state.listings.filter(p=>(view.type==='All'||p.type===view.type)&&(view.purpose==='All'||p.purpose===view.purpose)&&(!view.max||p.price<=+view.max)&&(!q||[p.title,p.village,p.city,p.district,p.plotCode,p.survey,p.insights?.projectName].join(' ').toLowerCase().includes(q)));if(Classic.sort==='low')rows.sort((a,b)=>a.price-b.price);if(Classic.sort==='high')rows.sort((a,b)=>b.price-a.price);if(Classic.sort==='area')rows.sort((a,b)=>a.type.localeCompare(b.type)||a.unit.localeCompare(b.unit)||b.area-a.area);return rows}
header=function(){const side=Market.user?(buyerSide()?'Buyer workspace':'Seller / firm workspace'):'Property • Amaravati & beyond';$('header').innerHTML=`<div class="mark">${icon('home')}</div><div class="brand"><strong>Agent Mart</strong><small>${esc(side)}</small></div><button class="iconbtn" aria-label="Add property" onclick="classicAdd()">${icon('plus')}</button><button class="avatarbtn" aria-label="Account and firm dashboard" onclick="go('classicAccount')">${Market.user?esc(Market.user.name.slice(0,1)):icon('account')}</button>`;let active=['detail','marketProperty','edit','sellerEdit','dossier','classicDossier'].includes(route)?'home':['ref','preview'].includes(route)?'crda':route==='marketSaved'?'saved':route;$('nav').innerHTML=[['home','home','Properties'],['map','map','Map'],['legal','legal','Legal'],['crda','crda','CRDA plots'],['saved','saved','Saved']].map(([r,i,l])=>`<button class="${active===r?'active':''}" aria-label="${l}" onclick="go('${r}')">${icon(i)}<span>${l}</span></button>`).join('')};
function classicAdd(){if(Market.user){if(buyerSide()){go('classicAccount');toast('Sign in with a seller account to publish property.');return}go('sellerEdit');return}go('edit')}
function classicSearch(e){e.preventDefault();view.q=e.target.elements.namedItem('q').value;home()}
home=function(){const rows=classicRows();$('app').innerHTML=`<div class="classicintro"><div class="eyebrow">PROPERTY • LOCATION • INSIGHTS</div><h1>Find the right property.<br><em>Know the plot.</em></h1><p>Listings, legal search and CRDA maps. All in one place.</p><div class="introactions"><button class="btn" onclick="classicAdd()">${icon('plus')} List a property</button><button class="textaction" onclick="go('classicAccount')">${Market.user?'My dashboard':'Buyer / seller login'} →</button></div></div>${Market.user?`<div class="classicstatus"><span>${Market.demo?'OFFLINE DEMO':buyerSide()?'BUYER ACCOUNT':'FIRM INVENTORY'}</span><button onclick="go('${buyerSide()?'marketRequests':'sellerHome'}')">${buyerSide()?'My enquiries':'Firm dashboard'} →</button></div>`:'<div class="classicstatus"><span>LOCAL PROPERTY TOOLS</span><small>Fictional examples are labelled.</small></div>'}<form class="searchline classicsearch" onsubmit="classicSearch(event)"><span>${icon('search')}</span><input name="q" aria-label="Search properties" value="${esc(view.q)}" placeholder="Village, city, project or plot code"><button class="btn" aria-label="Search">Go</button></form><div class="chips">${['All','Plot','Apartment','House','Commercial','Farm land'].map(x=>`<button class="chip ${view.type===x?'active':''}" onclick="setFilter('type','${x}')">${x==='Apartment'?'Flats':x==='All'?'All property':x}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="classictools"><button onclick="go('plotAI')">${icon('search')} Plot AI search</button><button onclick="go('investment')">${icon('map')} 10-year outlook</button></div><details class="classicfilters"><summary>Budget & purpose filters${view.max?' · active':''}</summary><div class="grid"><div><label>Purpose</label><select onchange="setFilter('purpose',this.value)">${options(['All','Sale','Rent'],view.purpose)}</select></div><div><label>Maximum budget (INR)</label><input aria-label="Maximum budget" type="number" min="0" value="${esc(view.max)}" onchange="setFilter('max',this.value)"></div></div><button class="textaction" onclick="view.q='';view.max='';view.type='All';view.purpose='All';home()">Clear filters</button></details><div class="row sectionhead"><div><h2>Property listings</h2><small>${rows.length} ${Market.user&&!Market.demo?'visible':'local / sample'} results</small></div><select class="classicsort" aria-label="Sort properties" onchange="Classic.sort=this.value;home()"><option value="recent" ${Classic.sort==='recent'?'selected':''}>Default order</option><option value="low" ${Classic.sort==='low'?'selected':''}>Price: low to high</option><option value="high" ${Classic.sort==='high'?'selected':''}>Price: high to low</option><option value="area" ${Classic.sort==='area'?'selected':''}>Area by type / unit</option></select></div><div class="cards classiccards">${rows.map(card).join('')||empty('No matching properties','Change your filters or add a property to your inventory.')}</div><div class="classicfoot"><b>Check the details before deciding.</b><p>Seller facts, map references and source records have different meanings. Sample listings are fictional. Future values use editable assumptions.</p><button onclick="go('about')">Sources & app information →</button></div>`};
card=function(p){const flat=p.type==='Apartment',x=p.insights||{},saved=classicSaved().includes(p.id);return `<article class="card classiccard"><div class="visual" onclick="go('detail',{id:'${p.id}'})">${p.photo?`<img src="${p.photo}" alt="Property photo">`:illustration(p)}<span class="tag ${p.demo||Market.demo?'amber':''}">${p.demo||Market.demo?'FICTIONAL SAMPLE':Market.user&&!buyerSide()?(p.published?'PUBLISHED':'PRIVATE INVENTORY'):esc(p.status||'SELLER PUBLISHED')}</span>${!p.photo?'<small>Illustration</small>':''}<button class="savefloat" aria-label="Save property" onclick="event.stopPropagation();classicSave('${p.id}')">${saved?'♥':'♡'}</button></div><div class="cardbody"><div class="categoryline">${flat?'Flat / apartment':esc(p.type)} · ${esc(p.purpose)}</div><h3 onclick="go('detail',{id:'${p.id}'})">${esc(p.title)}</h3><small>${icon('pin')} ${esc(p.village)}, ${esc(p.city||p.district)}</small><div class="meta"><span>${fmt(p.area)} ${esc(p.unit)}</span><span>${flat?(p.bhk?esc(p.bhk)+' BHK':'BHK not supplied'):esc(p.facing||'Facing not supplied')}</span>${p.road?`<span>${fmt(p.road)} m road</span>`:''}</div><div class="row"><div class="price">${money(p.price)}${p.purpose==='Rent'?'<small> /mo</small>':''}</div><button class="btn secondary" onclick="go('detail',{id:'${p.id}'})">View details</button></div><div class="classiccardlinks"><button onclick="go('classicDossier',{id:'${p.id}'})">Property insights →</button><button onclick="go('legal',{id:'${p.id}'})">Legal checks</button></div></div></article>`};
async function classicSave(id){if(Market.user&&buyerSide()){await marketSave(id);return}toggleSave(id)}
savedPage=function(){if(Market.user&&buyerSide()){const ps=Market.catalog.filter(p=>Market.saved.includes(p.id));$('app').innerHTML=`<div class="eyebrow">YOUR PRIVATE SHORTLIST</div><h1>Saved properties</h1><div class="cards classiccards">${ps.map(card).join('')||empty('No saved properties in this view','Save a property from the catalogue. Some saved properties may have been withdrawn or filtered out.')}</div>`;return}classicBase.savedPage()};
function classicAccount(){if(Market.user){accountMarket();$('app').insertAdjacentHTML('afterbegin',`<div class="row classictools"><button onclick="go('home')">${icon('home')} Property listings</button><button onclick="go('${buyerSide()?'marketRequests':'sellerHome'}')">${icon('legal')} ${buyerSide()?'My enquiries':'Firm dashboard'}</button></div>`);return}$('app').innerHTML=`${backbtn()}<div class="eyebrow">BUYER • SELLER • REAL ESTATE FIRMS</div><h1>Your property workspace</h1><p class="muted">Keep browsing with the familiar property tools, or connect an account for shared work.</p><div class="panel"><h2>Buyer account</h2><p>Save property, contact sellers with consent and track enquiries and visits.</p><div class="row"><button class="btn grow" onclick="chooseMarketSide('buyer')">Buyer login</button><button class="btn outline grow" onclick="startMarketDemo('buyer')">Buyer demo</button></div></div><div class="panel"><h2>Seller & firm account</h2><p>Private inventory, listing publication, buyer enquiries and multi-user firm access.</p><div class="row"><button class="btn grow" onclick="chooseMarketSide('seller')">Seller login</button><button class="btn outline grow" onclick="startMarketDemo('seller')">Firm demo</button></div></div><div class="panel"><h2>Local property tools</h2><p>Your earlier device-local listings and CRDA references remain available here.</p><button class="btn secondary full" onclick="go('home')">Continue with properties</button></div><button class="btn outline full" onclick="go('firmSettings')">Connect HTTPS backend</button><p class="footertext">Demo accounts and evidence are fictional. Real multi-user access requires the supplied backend to be hosted. No Landeed provider is connected.</p>`}
function classicDashboard(){const ps=Market.inventory,rs=Market.requests;$('app').innerHTML=`${backbtn()}${sessionBanner()}<div class="hero firmhero"><div class="eyebrow">FIRM DASHBOARD</div><h1>${esc(Firm.data?.firm?.name||'My property firm')}</h1><p>${esc(Market.user.name)} · ${esc(Market.user.role)}</p><button class="btn" onclick="go('home')">Open property inventory</button></div><div class="grid classicmetrics">${[[ps.length,'Visible properties'],[ps.filter(p=>p.published).length,'Published listings'],[rs.filter(r=>r.status==='Pending').length,'New buyer enquiries'],[rs.filter(r=>r.buyerConfirmedVisit).length,'Buyer-confirmed visits']].map(([n,l])=>`<div class="stat"><div class="pillcount">${n}</div><small>${l}</small></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="row sectionhead"><h2>Workspace actions</h2></div><div class="actiongrid">${[['home','home','Property listings'],['marketRequests','legal','Buyer enquiries'],['visits','pin','Firm site visits'],['team','saved','Team & access'],['branches','crda','Branches'],['reports','map','Firm reports']].map(([r,i,l])=>`<button class="actiontile" onclick="go('${r}')">${icon(i)}<strong>${l}</strong></button>`).join('')}</div><div class="panel" style="margin-top:18px"><h2>Drafts needing review</h2>${ps.filter(p=>!p.published).slice(0,5).map(p=>`<div class="listrow"><strong>${esc(p.title)}</strong><small>Private inventory; review before publication.</small><button class="btn secondary" onclick="go('detail',{id:'${p.id}'})">Review listing</button></div>`).join('')||'<p class="muted">No unpublished properties in your visible inventory.</p>'}</div><button class="btn outline full" onclick="go('marketSecurity')">Account security & sessions</button>`}
detail=function(){if(Market.user){classicBase.marketProperty();return}classicBase.detail();const p=state.listings.find(x=>x.id===args.id);if(!p)return;const hero=$('app').querySelector('.visual');if(hero)hero.classList.add('classicdetailvisual');const intro=$('app').querySelector('.panel');if(intro)intro.insertAdjacentHTML('beforebegin',classicInsightEntry(p))};
function classicInsightEntry(p){return `<div class="classicdetailtools"><button onclick="go('classicDossier',{id:'${p.id}'})">${icon('search')} In-depth insights</button><button onclick="go('legal',{id:'${p.id}'})">${icon('legal')} Legal search</button><button onclick="classicGrowth('${p.id}')">${icon('map')} 10-year outlook</button></div>`}
function classicGrowth(id){const p=state.listings.find(x=>x.id===id);if(p?.purpose==='Sale'&&p.price){Growth.price=p.price;Growth.label='Seller asking price used as an unverified input.'}else Growth.label='Enter a purchase price; monthly rent is not a purchase value.';go('investment')}
function classicDossier(){const p=state.listings.find(x=>x.id===args.id);if(!p){$('app').innerHTML=empty('Property unavailable','Return to the property list.');return}const x=p.insights||{},flat=p.type==='Apartment',sample=window.DILIGENCE_SAMPLES[flat?'Apartment':'Plot'];$('app').innerHTML=`${backbtn()}<div class="classicinsighthead"><div class="eyebrow">IN-DEPTH PROPERTY INSIGHTS</div><h1>${esc(p.title)}</h1><p>${flat?'Project, area and occupancy checks':'Parcel identity, access and source records'}</p></div><div class="panel"><h2>Property snapshot</h2><div class="facts">${fact('Type',p.type)}${fact('Listed area',fmt(p.area)+' '+p.unit)}${fact('Asking price',money(p.price)+(p.purpose==='Rent'?' / month':''))}${fact('Village / locality',p.village)}${fact('Survey / plot code',p.plotCode||p.survey)}${fact('Price per listed unit',p.area&&p.price?money(p.price/p.area)+' / '+p.unit:null)}</div><p class="mini muted">Seller inputs and asking price, not independently verified records or a valuation.</p></div><div class="panel"><h2>${flat?'Flat & project details':'Plot & access details'}</h2><div class="facts">${(flat?['projectName','builder','areaBasis','carpetArea','superArea','floor','totalFloors','parking','uds','rera','oc','cc','maintenance']:['lengthM','widthM','roadStatus','landUse','water','power','drainage','boundary']).map(k=>fact(extraLabels[k],x[k])).join('')}</div></div><div class="panel"><h2>Questions to resolve</h2><ul class="insightlist">${flat?'<li>Compare the listed area with the agreement on the same carpet or built-up basis.</li><li>Request applicable project approvals, possession and occupancy records.</li><li>Confirm unit identity, parking rights, land share and unpaid dues.</li>':'<li>Match deed, survey, subdivision, extent and boundary records.</li><li>Check lawful access, current road formation and permitted land use.</li><li>Confirm boundaries and utilities through an independent site check.</li>'}<li>Review ownership history, charges and missing search periods with appropriate professional support.</li></ul></div><div class="panel"><h2>Document insights</h2><div class="notice blue">No live title-report provider is connected. Ownership, charges, litigation and approvals remain unverified until relevant source records are retrieved and reviewed.</div>${p.demo||Market.demo?`<details><summary>View a fictional ${flat?'flat':'plot'} report example</summary><p class="mini">This separate example explains the report structure. It is not a report on this listing, and no Landeed or government search was performed.</p>${sample.sections.map(s=>`<div class="sourcefinding"><strong>${esc(s.title)} · ${esc(s.status)}</strong><p class="mini">${esc(s.summary)}</p>${s.findings.map(f=>`<small>${esc(f.text)} · Fictional source ${esc(f.source_id||'not supplied')}${f.page?' / page '+f.page:''}</small>`).join('')}</div>`).join('')}</details>`:''}<button class="btn secondary full" onclick="go('legal',{id:'${p.id}'})">Open legal search & document checklist</button></div><div class="classicdetailtools"><button onclick="classicPlot('${p.id}')">Nearby & plot AI</button><button onclick="classicGrowth('${p.id}')">10-year scenarios</button></div>`}
function classicPlot(id){const p=state.listings.find(x=>x.id===id);Insight.query=p?.plotCode&&!p.demo?p.plotCode:'';go('plotAI')}
const classicOldMarketProperty=marketProperty;
marketProperty=async function(){await classicOldMarketProperty();if(route!=='detail'&&route!=='marketProperty')return;const p=Market.active;if(!p)return;const cover=$('propertyCover');if(cover&&!$('classicDetailActions'))cover.insertAdjacentHTML('afterend',`<div id="classicDetailActions">${classicInsightEntry(p)}</div>`);header()};
// Use the wrapped version for the legacy property route as well.
detail=function(){if(Market.user){marketProperty();return}classicBase.detail();const p=state.listings.find(x=>x.id===args.id);if(p){const el=$('app').querySelector('.panel');if(el)el.insertAdjacentHTML('beforebegin',classicInsightEntry(p))}};
const classicRender=render;
render=function(){if(Market.user&&!Market.demo&&!Firm.token){Market.user=null;Market.side='';Market.inventory=[];Market.catalog=[];Market.requests=[];restoreLocal();route='home'}if(['portal','buyerHome','catalog'].includes(route)){route='home';args={}}if(route==='firm'){route=Market.user&&!buyerSide()?'sellerHome':'classicAccount'}if(route==='marketProperty')route='detail';if(route==='dossier')route='classicDossier';if(route==='marketSaved')route='saved';if(route==='home'){header();home();return}if(route==='detail'){header();detail();return}if(route==='saved'){header();savedPage();return}if(route==='classicAccount'){header();classicAccount();return}if(route==='classicDossier'){header();classicDossier();return}if(route==='sellerHome'&&Market.user){header();classicDashboard();return}classicRender();header()};
startMarketDemo=function(side){view.q='';view.type='All';view.purpose='All';view.max='';classicBase.startMarketDemo(side);if(side==='buyer'){state.listings=Market.catalog;render()}};
marketLogout=async function(){await classicBase.marketLogout();view.q='';view.type='All';view.purpose='All';view.max='';route='home';args={};stack=[];render()};
// Retain the existing v2/v3 local storage identity and open the familiar home.
route='home';args={};stack=[];render();
// Clear role entry; listing creation belongs to seller accounts only.
const Roles42={query:'',filter:'all',busy:false};
const interestStages=['New interest','Contacted','Documents requested','Visit planning','Negotiation','Completed','Not proceeding'];
const rolesBase={render,header,home,threadMarket,marketLogout,startMarketDemo,classicDashboard};
function hasRoleAccount(){return !!Market.user&&(Market.demo||!!Firm.token)}
function rolesEntry(){Market.side='';$('app').innerHTML=`<div class="rolewelcome"><span class="eyebrow">AGENT MART</span><h1>Your property journey.<br><em>Choose your workspace.</em></h1><p>Buyers discover and track interest. Sellers and owners list property and manage follow-ups.</p></div><section class="rolechoice buyerchoice"><div class="rolechoicehead"><span class="rolebadge">${icon('search')}</span><div><h2>Buyer</h2><small>Find the right plot, flat or property</small></div></div><ul><li>Browse published listings across seller firms</li><li>Save, compare and mark interest</li><li>Track seller responses, documents and visits</li></ul><div class="rolebuttons"><button class="btn" onclick="openRoleAuth('buyer','login')">Buyer login</button><button class="btn outline" onclick="openRoleAuth('buyer','register')">Create buyer account</button></div><button class="demolink" onclick="startMarketDemo('buyer')">View buyer demo →</button></section><section class="rolechoice sellerchoice"><div class="rolechoicehead"><span class="rolebadge">${icon('home')}</span><div><h2>Seller / Property owner</h2><small>Individual owners and real estate firms</small></div></div><ul><li>Create, edit and publish your listings</li><li>Manage interested buyers and next follow-ups</li><li>Control visits, source documents and firm access</li></ul><div class="rolebuttons"><button class="btn" onclick="openRoleAuth('seller','login')">Seller / owner login</button><button class="btn outline" onclick="openRoleAuth('seller','register')">Create seller account</button></div><button class="demolink" onclick="startMarketDemo('seller')">View seller / owner demo →</button></section><div class="entryfooter"><button onclick="go('firmSettings')">${icon('crda')} Connect your backend</button><p>Demo records are fictional. Real accounts require the hosted HTTPS backend. The same email cannot be both a buyer and seller account in this pilot.</p></div>`}
function openRoleAuth(side,mode){Market.side=side;go('marketAuth',{side,mode})}
marketAuthPage=function(){const side=args.side||'buyer',mode=args.mode||'login',seller=side==='seller';Market.side=side;$('app').innerHTML=`${backbtn()}<div class="authwelcome"><span class="tag">${seller?'SELLER / OWNER':'BUYER'}</span><h1>${mode==='login'?'Welcome back.':mode==='join'?'Join your real estate firm.':'Create your '+(seller?'seller':'buyer')+' account.'}</h1><p>${seller?'Manage your own inventory and interested buyers.':'Explore listings across all connected seller firms.'}</p></div><div class="chips">${[['login','Login'],['register','Create account'],...(seller?[['join','Staff invitation']]:[])].map(([m,l])=>`<button class="chip ${mode===m?'active':''}" onclick="args.mode='${m}';marketAuthPage()">${l}</button>`).join('')}</div><form class="panel" onsubmit="roleAuthenticate(event,'${side}','${mode}')">${mode!=='login'?input('Your full name','name','','text',true):''}${seller&&mode==='register'?`${select('Account type','accountType',['Individual property owner','Real estate firm'],'Individual property owner')}${input('Owner / business display name','firmName','','text',true)}`:''}${input('Email','email','','email',true)}${input(mode==='login'?'Password':'New passphrase (15+ characters)','password','','password',true,`minlength="${mode==='login'?10:15}" maxlength="200" autocomplete="${mode==='login'?'current-password':'new-password'}"`)}${mode!=='login'?input('Confirm passphrase','confirmPassword','','password',true,'minlength="15" maxlength="200"'):''}${mode==='join'?input('One-time staff invitation','inviteCode','','text',true):''}${mode==='login'?input('Authenticator / recovery code, if enabled','otp','','text',false,'autocomplete="one-time-code"'):''}<div class="space"></div><button class="btn full" type="submit">${mode==='login'?'Login to '+(seller?'seller / owner':'buyer')+' dashboard':mode==='join'?'Join firm':'Create '+(seller?'seller / owner':'buyer')+' account'}</button></form><p class="tabnote">${Firm.endpoint?'Connected server: '+esc(Firm.endpoint):'Connect a deployed backend to create real accounts. You can explore a demo now.'}</p><div class="row"><button class="btn secondary grow" onclick="startMarketDemo('${side}')">${seller?'Seller / owner':'Buyer'} demo</button><button class="btn outline grow" onclick="go('firmSettings')">Backend settings</button></div><p class="footertext">Account login does not verify property ownership. New seller registrations become the owner of their own workspace. Staff access requires an owner-issued invitation.</p>`}
async function roleAuthenticate(e,side,mode){e.preventDefault();const f=e.target;if(mode!=='login'&&f.elements.namedItem('password').value!==f.elements.namedItem('confirmPassword').value){toast('The passphrases do not match.');return}await marketAuthenticate(e,side,mode)}
classicAdd=function(){if(!hasRoleAccount()){openRoleAuth('seller','login');return}if(buyerSide()){toast('Only a seller or owner account can list property.');return}go('sellerEdit')};
header=function(){if(!hasRoleAccount()){$('header').innerHTML=`<div class="mark">${icon('home')}</div><div class="brand"><strong>Agent Mart</strong><small>BUY • SELL • INSIGHTS</small></div><button class="iconbtn" aria-label="Choose buyer or seller" onclick="route='roleEntry';args={};render()">${icon('account')}</button>`;$('nav').innerHTML='';return}rolesBase.header();$('header').querySelector('.brand small').textContent=buyerSide()?'BUYER • DISCOVER & TRACK':'SELLER / OWNER • MY INVENTORY';if(buyerSide())$('header').querySelector('[aria-label="Add property"]')?.remove();$('header').insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<button class="iconbtn interestbell" aria-label="${buyerSide()?'My interests':'Interested buyers'}" onclick="go('marketRequests')">${icon('legal')}</button>`)};
home=function(){if(!hasRoleAccount()){rolesEntry();return}rolesBase.home();const hero=$('app').querySelector('.classicintro');if(hero){hero.querySelector('.eyebrow').textContent=buyerSide()?'BUYER DASHBOARD • PROPERTY DISCOVERY':'SELLER / OWNER • PROPERTY INVENTORY';hero.querySelector('h1').innerHTML=buyerSide()?'Find your property.<br><em>Track every interest.</em>':'Your property listings.<br><em>Your buyer follow-ups.</em>';hero.querySelector('p').textContent=buyerSide()?'Explore published properties from all seller firms.':'Create private listings, review them and publish to buyers.';hero.querySelector('.introactions').innerHTML=buyerSide()?`<button class="btn" onclick="go('marketRequests')">My interests (${Market.requests.length})</button><button class="textaction" onclick="go('saved')">Saved properties →</button>`:`<button class="btn" onclick="classicAdd()">+ Add property</button><button class="textaction" onclick="go('marketRequests')">Interested buyers →</button>`}if(buyerSide()){const status=$('app').querySelector('.classicstatus');if(status)status.innerHTML=`<span>${Market.demo?'DEMO BUYER • FICTIONAL LISTINGS':'ALL SELLER FIRMS • PUBLISHED LISTINGS'}</span><button onclick="go('marketRequests')">My interests →</button>`}else{const status=$('app').querySelector('.classicstatus');if(status)status.innerHTML=`<span>${Market.demo?'DEMO OWNER':'MY FIRM INVENTORY'}</span><button onclick="go('sellerHome')">Dashboard →</button>`}};
function isFollowupDue(r){const f=r.followUp;return ['Pending','Accepted'].includes(r.status)&&f?.nextAt&&!['Completed','Not proceeding'].includes(f.stage)&&new Date(f.nextAt)<=new Date()}
requestsMarket=async function(){const session=Firm.token;if(marketLive())await refreshMarket(false);if(route!=='marketRequests'||session!==Firm.token)return;const all=Market.requests,q=Roles42.query.toLowerCase(),rows=all.filter(r=>(!q||[r.propertyTitle,r.buyerName,r.interestStage].join(' ').toLowerCase().includes(q))&&(Roles42.filter==='all'||Roles42.filter==='due'?Roles42.filter!=='due'||isFollowupDue(r):r.status===Roles42.filter));$('app').innerHTML=`<div class="eyebrow">${buyerSide()?'BUYER DASHBOARD':'SELLER / OWNER DASHBOARD'}</div><h1>${buyerSide()?'My property interests':'Interested buyers & follow-ups'}</h1><p class="muted">${buyerSide()?'Track your requests, seller responses and visit proposals.':'Respond to new interest, set a stage and keep the next action visible.'}</p><div class="interestcounts"><div><strong>${all.length}</strong><small>Total</small></div><div><strong>${all.filter(r=>r.status==='Pending').length}</strong><small>Awaiting response</small></div><div><strong>${buyerSide()?all.filter(r=>r.buyerConfirmedVisit).length:all.filter(isFollowupDue).length}</strong><small>${buyerSide()?'Confirmed visits':'Follow-ups due'}</small></div></div><form class="searchline classicsearch" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();Roles42.query=this.elements.namedItem('q').value;requestsMarket()"><input name="q" aria-label="Search interests" value="${esc(Roles42.query)}" placeholder="Property${buyerSide()?'':' or buyer'} name"><button class="btn">Search</button></form><div class="chips">${[['all','All'],['Pending','New'],['Accepted','Active'],...(!buyerSide()?[['due','Follow-ups due']]:[]),['Closed','Closed'],['Declined','Declined']].map(([k,l])=>`<button class="chip ${Roles42.filter===k?'active':''}" onclick="Roles42.filter='${k}';requestsMarket()">${l}</button>`).join('')}</div>${rows.map(r=>`<article class="interestcard"><div class="row"><span class="tag ${isFollowupDue(r)?'amber':''}">${esc(r.status)}</span><small>${new Date(r.created).toLocaleDateString('en-IN')}</small></div><h3>${esc(r.propertyTitle)}</h3>${!buyerSide()?`<p>${esc(r.buyerName)}</p>`:''}<div class="intereststage">${esc(r.interestStage||r.followUp?.stage||'New interest')}</div>${!buyerSide()&&r.followUp?.nextAt?`<small class="${isFollowupDue(r)?'due':''}">Next follow-up: ${new Date(r.followUp.nextAt).toLocaleString('en-IN')}</small>`:''}${r.visit?`<small>Site visit: ${new Date(r.visit.scheduled).toLocaleString('en-IN')} · ${esc(r.visit.status)}</small>`:''}<button class="btn secondary full" onclick="go('marketThread',{id:'${r.id}'})">${buyerSide()?'Open interest & seller response':'Open buyer & next action'} →</button></article>`).join('')||empty(buyerSide()?'No matching interests':'No matching buyers',buyerSide()?'Open a property and tap I am interested.':'Publish your listings to receive buyer interest.')}<p class="footertext">${buyerSide()?'The seller controls their response. Interest is not a booking, reservation or ownership transfer.':'Private follow-up notes are visible only to authorized firm staff. Stages are shared with the interested buyer. Follow-up reminders are shown in this dashboard; push delivery is not configured.'}</p>`};
function followupPanel(r){const f=r.followUp||{},when=f.nextAt?new Date(new Date(f.nextAt).getTime()-new Date(f.nextAt).getTimezoneOffset()*60000).toISOString().slice(0,16):'';return `<section class="panel followupform" id="followupPanel"><h2>Next buyer follow-up</h2><p class="mini muted">The stage is visible to the buyer. Your notes and next follow-up time stay inside the seller firm.</p><form onsubmit="saveRoleFollowup(event,'${r.id}')">${select('Buyer interest stage','stage',interestStages,f.stage||r.interestStage||'New interest')}<label>Next follow-up date & time (optional)</label><input name="nextAt" type="datetime-local" value="${when}"><label>Private firm note</label><textarea name="note" maxlength="2000" placeholder="Documents to request, call outcome or next task">${esc(f.note||'')}</textarea><small>Clear the date for Completed / Not proceeding. This records a task; no call or notification is sent automatically.</small><div class="space"></div><button class="btn full">Save follow-up</button></form>${r.followUpHistory?.length?`<details><summary>Follow-up history (${r.followUpHistory.length})</summary>${r.followUpHistory.map(h=>`<div class="listrow"><strong>${esc(h.stage)}</strong><small>${new Date(h.created).toLocaleString('en-IN')}</small><p class="mini">${esc(h.note||'No note')}</p></div>`).join('')}</details>`:''}</section>`}
async function saveRoleFollowup(e,id){e.preventDefault();const b=e.target.querySelector('button');b.disabled=true;try{const d=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(e.target));d.nextAt=d.nextAt?new Date(d.nextAt).toISOString():null;d.version=Market.thread.version;if(Market.demo){const r=marketDemo.requests.find(r=>r.id===id);if(d.nextAt&&new Date(d.nextAt)<=new Date())throw Error('Choose a future follow-up time.');if(['Completed','Not proceeding'].includes(d.stage)&&d.nextAt)throw Error('Clear the next follow-up for a completed interest.');r.followUp={stage:d.stage,nextAt:d.nextAt,note:d.note,updated:new Date().toISOString()};r.interestStage=d.stage;r.version++;r.followUpHistory=[{stage:d.stage,next_at:d.nextAt,note:d.note,created:new Date().toISOString(),actor_id:Market.user.id},...(r.followUpHistory||[])];saveMarketDemo()}else await marketCall('POST','/api/market/requests/'+id+'/follow-up',d);await refreshMarket(false);await threadMarket();toast('Follow-up saved')}catch(e){toast(e.message)}finally{b.disabled=false}}
threadMarket=async function(){const id=args.id,session=Firm.token;await rolesBase.threadMarket();if(route!=='marketThread'||args.id!==id||Firm.token!==session||!Market.thread)return;const r=Market.thread,head=$('app').querySelector('.conversation');if(buyerSide()){head?.insertAdjacentHTML('beforebegin',`<div class="interestprogress"><strong>Interest progress: ${esc(r.interestStage||'New interest')}</strong><small>Request ${esc(r.status.toLowerCase())}${r.buyerConfirmedVisit?' · Site visit confirmed by you':''}</small></div>`)}else if(['Pending','Accepted'].includes(r.status)){const form=$('app').querySelector('form');if(form)form.insertAdjacentHTML('beforebegin',followupPanel(r));else $('app').insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',followupPanel(r))}if(['Pending','Accepted'].includes(r.status))$('app').insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<button class="btn outline full" onclick="closeRoleInterest('${r.id}')">${buyerSide()?'Withdraw this interest':'Close this interest'}</button>`)};
async function closeRoleInterest(id){if(!confirm('Close this interest? Future messages and document access stop; existing copies cannot be recalled.'))return;try{if(Market.demo){const r=marketDemo.requests.find(r=>r.id===id);r.status='Closed';r.version++;saveMarketDemo()}else await marketCall('POST','/api/market/requests/'+id+'/close',{version:Market.thread.version});await refreshMarket(false);threadMarket()}catch(e){toast(e.message)}}
const roleProperty=marketProperty;
marketProperty=async function(){await roleProperty();if(!['detail','marketProperty'].includes(route))return;if(buyerSide()){const form=$('app').querySelector('form[onsubmit^="submitMarketEnquiry"]');if(form){form.querySelector('button').textContent='I am interested';form.querySelector('textarea').placeholder='I am interested in this property. Please contact me and share the relevant details.'}}};
classicDashboard=function(){rolesBase.classicDashboard();const due=Market.requests.filter(isFollowupDue),panel=$('app').querySelector('.actiongrid');if(panel)panel.insertAdjacentHTML('beforebegin',`<button class="followupcallout" onclick="Roles42.filter='due';go('marketRequests')"><span>${icon('legal')} Buyer follow-ups due</span><strong>${due.length} →</strong></button>`);$('app').insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<button class="btn secondary full" style="margin-top:12px" onclick="classicAdd()">+ Add a property listing</button>`)};
classicAccount=function(){if(!hasRoleAccount()){rolesEntry();return}accountMarket();$('app').insertAdjacentHTML('afterbegin',`<div class="classictools"><button onclick="go('home')">${icon('home')} ${buyerSide()?'Browse all sellers':'My property listings'}</button><button onclick="go('${buyerSide()?'marketRequests':'sellerHome'}')">${icon('legal')} ${buyerSide()?'My interests':'Seller dashboard'}</button></div>`)};
const roleRender=render;
render=function(){if(Market.user&&!Market.demo&&!Firm.token){Market.user=null;Market.side='';Market.catalog=[];Market.inventory=[];Market.requests=[]}if(!hasRoleAccount()){if(!['roleEntry','marketAuth','firmSettings','about'].includes(route)){route='roleEntry';args={}}if(route==='roleEntry'){header();rolesEntry();return}}if(hasRoleAccount()&&buyerSide()&&['edit','sellerEdit','sellerInventory','sellerHome','team','branches','reports','activity','leads','leadEdit','visits','visitEdit','firmMore'].includes(route)){route='home';args={};toast('Buyer accounts can browse and enquire. Seller tools require a seller account.')}roleRender();header()};
function seedRoleInterestDemo(){if(marketDemo.requests.length||localStorage.getItem('role42_demo_seeded'))return;const ps=marketDemo.properties.filter(p=>p.published);for(let i=0;i<Math.min(2,ps.length);i++){const accepted=i===1;marketDemo.requests.push({id:'role42sample'+i,propertyId:ps[i].id,propertyTitle:ps[i].title,buyerName:'Ananya • Demo Buyer',status:accepted?'Accepted':'Pending',version:1,created:new Date().toISOString(),messages:[{id:'role42msg'+i,sender_id:'demoBuyer',body:'Fictional demo interest: please share details and source documents.',created:new Date().toISOString()}],documents:[],interestStage:accepted?'Contacted':'New interest',followUp:accepted?{stage:'Contacted',nextAt:new Date(Date.now()-3600000).toISOString(),note:'Fictional private seller task: request relevant property documents.',updated:new Date().toISOString()}:undefined})}localStorage.setItem('role42_demo_seeded','1');saveMarketDemo()}
startMarketDemo=function(side){Roles42.query='';Roles42.filter='all';rolesBase.startMarketDemo(side);seedRoleInterestDemo();Market.requests=marketDemo.requests;if(side==='buyer'){route='home';state.listings=Market.catalog}render()};
