aboutPage=function(){$('app').innerHTML=`${backbtn()}<div class="eyebrow">AGENT MART • 4.3</div><h1>Data & app information</h1><section class="panel"><h2>Buyer and seller workspaces</h2><p>Buyer discovery, seller inventory, publication, interest tracking, follow-ups, maps, legal tools and CRDA parcel references.</p><p>Real accounts require your deployed HTTPS backend. Demo accounts, listings and report examples are fictional.</p></section><section class="panel"><h2>Language selection</h2><p>English, Telugu and Hindi are available for main navigation, account controls and property-form labels. Some supporting technical help remains in English. Listing descriptions, personal names, plot identifiers and source records retain their original text.</p><button class="btn outline full" onclick="chooseLanguage43()">Choose language</button></section><section class="panel"><h2>Sources and verification</h2><p>Seller disclosures are not legal verification. Live title-report procurement is not connected. The existing GIS, nearby-place and optional AI services require network availability or configuration.</p><a href="${GIS}">APCRDA GIS plot layer ↗</a><br><a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">OpenStreetMap contributors ↗</a></section><div class="notice">Version 4.5 uses the same prototype package and signing identity as v2-v4.4. Back up device-local data before changing installations. Physical Android installation and upgrade have not been tested here.</div>`};

